  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a large saucepan over medium heat.",
    "Add the onion, garlic, and ginger and saute until the onion is translucent.",
    "Add the scotch bonnet pepper and curry powder and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the mung bean sprouts, coconut milk, vegetable broth, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Bring the mixture to a boil, then reduce the heat to low and simmer for 20 minutes.",
    "Stir occasionally to prevent the sprouts from sticking to the bottom of the pan.",
    "Taste and adjust the seasoning as needed.",
    "Serve the curry hot, garnished with chopped fresh herbs if desired."
